              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.12+DEU.5.13+DEU.5.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guteg 5.12-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.17.21+JER.17.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 17.21-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Muri iyo minsi mbona i Buyuda abantu bengera mu mivure ku isabato, n'abandi bazana imiba bakayikoreza indogobe zabo, mbona na vino n'inzabibu n'imbuto z'imitini n'imitwaro y'uburyo bwose, bazanaga muri Yerusalemu ku isabato. Nabaye umugabo wo kubashinja ku munsi baguriyeho ibyokurya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi hariho abagabo b'i Tiro bazanaga amafi n'ibintu by'uburyo bwose, bakagura n'Abayuda ku isabato muri Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ntonganya impfura zo mu Bayuda ndababaza nti “Ni iki cyabateye gukora icyaha gisa gityo mugasuzuguza umunsi w'isabato? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese ba sogokuruza banyu si uko babigenje, bigatuma Imana yacu ituzanaho ibi byago no kuri uyu murwa? None namwe mugiye kongerera Abisirayeli uburakari muzira gusuzuguza isabato.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ku munsi ubanziriza isabato bugorobye, ntegeka yuko inzugi z'amarembo y'i Yerusalemu zikingwa, kandi ko zidakingurwa kugeza aho isabato ishirira, maze nshyira bamwe mu bagaragu banjye ku marembo kugira ngo hatagira umutwaro wose binjiza ku munsi w'isabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze abatunzi n'abagura ibintu by'uburyo bwose, barara inyuma y'i Yerusalemu rimwe cyangwa kabiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbabonye ndabahamya ndababaza nti “Ni iki gituma murara inyuma y'inkike? Nimwongera nzabafata.” Maze uhereye uwo munsi ntibongera kugaruka ku isabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mperako ntegeka Abalewi ngo biyeze babone kuza kurinda amarembo, beze umunsi w'isabato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana yanjye, n'ibi na byo ubinyibukire, umbabarire uko imbabazi zawe nyinshi zingana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gushyingirana n'ayandi mahanga bihanwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
